  "place": "Tag 0FPM, lemma-cup-product-commutative (and Tag 0FPL, associativity); supported refinement formulated by the agent from the tensor-morphism construction in def-pur-supported-cup, Stacks Tag 09XP localization, Tag 03PL Kummer sequence, and Tag 0G78 supported functoriality (cohomology.tex). Pro-etale comparison compatibility is part of this auxiliary statement, not an assertion that 0FPM alone states it."
 },
 "proof": [
  {
   "text": "Select the actual small site before constructing its sheaf and derived categories. Use the existing underived support source and signed Tate line, the exact-functor single comparison and its shift comparison. Conjugate by the uniquely normalized endpoint isomorphisms. The short exact open/closed coefficient sequence supplies its actual single-delta boundary. The finite Tate data retain all normalized multiplication equations. These constructions define the same operations as the original interface.",
